    "description": "Various Crystals, Gemstone, Ores, Volcanic Glass, Minerals Lot\nThis is a previously owned item being sold AS IS. Items may have light surface dust/debris and scratches.\nGems are tested on a Presidium Gem Tester II. Many gemstone properties overlap and could potentially be one of many varieties of gemstones.\nWe do not have the equipment to distinguish between natural and man-made gems.\nThe weight shown in the images has the box and the plastic liner included. Please keep this in mind when bidding.\nItems are represented to the best of our ability. We are not experts in any field. Items are previously owned/used and donated. They may contain unseen flaws which are unable to be ascertain by the staff. All items are sold \"AS IS.\" No Returns or Refunds. Items may be missing cords, batteries, parts, and/or accessories. Please contact us PRIOR to bidding to clarify any questions or concerns.\nREAD ALL BELOW INFORMATION. REFUNDS WILL BE REFUSED IF YOU DO NOT READ THE DETAILS BELOW!\nLOCAL PICKUP INFORMATION\nLocal Pickup Time Slots Are Available:\nMonday - Friday, 1:00pm - 4:00pm.\nAPPOINTMENTS REQUIRED\nLocal Pickup Requirements:\nYou are\nREQUIRED\nto schedule your pickup appointment in an available time slot as well as provide the order number for verification at pickup. If you do not provide your order number or show up outside of your selected time slot, we\nwill NOT dispense your items to you\nand you will need to reschedule your appointment.\nABANDONED ITEMS:\nAfter paying for your auction, you have seven (7) days to schedule a pickup appointment. If you do not schedule your appointment within seven days after paying for your auction, or miss your pickup appointment and do not reschedule it within another 7 days, your items will be considered abandoned and will be processed as a donation\nWITHOUT REFUND\n. If something happens, reach out to us before any deadlines end and we will typically work with you.\nHOW TO SCHEDULE A PICKUP\n:\nPay for